  "question": {
    "text": "Let the eccentricity of the hyperbola with the principal axes along the coordinate axes and passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>One vertex of the hyperbola is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;assuming the&nbsp;equation of hyperbola as <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />and passing&nbsp;through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
  }
